abstract: >-
  Reference simulation engine for the Woolly Protocol — a sovereign-chain
  blockchain architecture for sustainable food systems with novel Proof-of-Nourishment
  consensus, multi-agent on-chain auditability, avoided-emissions life-cycle dMRV,
  seed-to-fork chain of custody, and an effort-based food mining economic model.
  Reproduces all manuscript tables for the COMPAG 2026 submission.
